      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Alianait is presenting our second concert of the 2019 season, featuring four time Juno nominated pop-/rock singer-songwriter  HANNAH GEORGAS  on&nbsp; Saturday, April 27th&nbsp; at Inuksuk High School, starting at 7:30pm.&nbsp;   Her latest album “The Imprint” was released on March 8th f"
